{"url":"https://eyris-react.themenate.net/guide/shared-component-doc/icon-frame","title":"IconFrame","intro":"IconFrame is a container component for displaying icons with consistent styling. It supports multiple visual variants including default, thick adn layered styles.","sections":["Basic","Variants","Custom Size","API","IconFrame"],"code":["import IconFrame from '@/components/shared/IconFrame'\nimport { LiDollarCircle, LiUser, LiSetting } from '@/icons'\n\nconst Basic = () => {\n    return (\n        <div className=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <IconFrame>\n                <LiDollarCircle className=\"text-xl heading-text\" />\n            </IconFrame>\n            <IconFrame>\n                <LiUser className=\"text-xl heading-text\" />\n            </IconFrame>\n            <IconFrame>\n                <LiSetting className=\"text-xl heading-text\" />\n            </IconFrame>\n        </div>\n    )\n}\n\nexport default Basic\n","import IconFrame from '@/components/shared/IconFrame'\nimport { LiDollarCircle } from '@/icons'\n\nconst Variants = () => {\n    return (\n        <div className=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n                <IconFrame>\n                    <LiDollarCircle className=\"text-xl heading-text\" />\n                </IconFrame>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n                <IconFrame variant=\"thick\">\n                    <LiDollarCircle className=\"text-xl heading-text\" />\n                </IconFrame>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n                <IconFrame variant=\"layered\">\n                    <LiDollarCircle className=\"text-xl heading-text\" />\n                </IconFrame>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    )\n}\n\nexport default Variants\n","import IconFrame from '@/components/shared/IconFrame'\nimport { LiDollarCircle } from '@/icons'\n\nconst CustomSize = () => {\n    return (\n        <div className=\"flex items-end gap-4\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n                <IconFrame size={32}>\n                    <LiDollarCircle className=\"text-base heading-text\" />\n                </IconFrame>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n                <IconFrame size={40}>\n                    <LiDollarCircle className=\"text-xl heading-text\" />\n                </IconFrame>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n                <IconFrame size={56}>\n                    <LiDollarCircle className=\"text-2xl heading-text\" />\n                </IconFrame>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n                <IconFrame size={72}>\n                    <LiDollarCircle className=\"text-3xl heading-text\" />\n                </IconFrame>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    )\n}\n\nexport default CustomSize\n"],"tables":[[["PROP","DESCRIPTION","TYPE","DEFAULT"],["variant","Visual style variant of the icon frame","'default' | 'thick' | 'layered'","'default'"],["size","Width and height of the icon frame in pixels","number","40"],["children","Icon or content to display inside the frame","ReactNode","-"],["className","Additional CSS classes to apply to the frame","string","-"]]]}